  "sortOrder": 62004,
  "verseCount": 21,
  "aliases": [
    "1 John",
    "1John",
    "1 Jn",
    "1Jn"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Beloved, believe not every spirit, but try the spirits whether they are of God: because many false prophets are gone out into the world.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Hereby know ye the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesseth that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh is of God:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "And every spirit that confesseth not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh is not of God: and this is that spirit of antichrist, whereof ye have heard that it should come; and even now already is it in the world.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Ye are of God, little children, and have overcome them: because greater is he that is in you, than he that is in the world.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "They are of the world: therefore speak they of the world, and the world heareth them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "We are of God: he that knoweth God heareth us; he that is not of God heareth not us. Hereby know we the spirit of truth, and the spirit of error.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Beloved, let us love one another: for love is of God; and every one that loveth is born of God, and knoweth God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "He that loveth not knoweth not God; for God is love.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "In this was manifested the love of God toward us, because that God sent his only begotten Son into the world, that we might live through him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "Herein is love, not that we loved God, but that he loved us, and sent his Son to be the propitiation for our sins.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Beloved, if God so loved us, we ought also to love one another.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "No man hath seen God at any time. If we love one another, God dwelleth in us, and his love is perfected in us.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Hereby know we that we dwell in him, and he in us, because he hath given us of his Spirit.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "And we have seen and do testify that the Father sent the Son to be the Saviour of the world.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "Whosoever shall confess that Jesus is the Son of God, God dwelleth in him, and he in God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "And we have known and believed the love that God hath to us. God is love; and he that dwelleth in love dwelleth in God, and God in him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Herein is our love made perfect, that we may have boldness in the day of judgment: because as he is, so are we in this world.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "There is no fear in love; but perfect love casteth out fear: because fear hath torment. He that feareth is not made perfect in love.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "We love him, because he first loved us.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "If a man say, I love God, and hateth his brother, he is a liar: for he that loveth not his brother whom he hath seen, how can he love God whom he hath not seen?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-john:4:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "And this commandment have we from him, That he who loveth God love his brother also.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 John 4:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-john:4:21"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
